  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.5.0 Update ApexGantt core to 3.21.0. Opt-in Ignite UI theming: set ApexGanttConfiguration.IgniteUI = true and charts take their bar, grid, text and surface colours, font and light or dark variant from the Ignite UI theme on the page; the add-on is free and needs no license key, and GanttOptions.DesignSystem = false turns it off for one chart. GanttOptions gains ThemeName (a theme registered by name, or \"light\" or \"dark\"), Tokens and DesignSystem. Behaviour change from the core: an option passed to the chart now beats the chart's own CSS variable for the same setting (before, the CSS variable won).\n\n      1.4.0 Update ApexGantt core to 3.20.0. New methods: GetTaskAsync, GetTasksAsync and GetDependenciesAsync (copies of the chart's data, edits included, for saving), ExpandTaskAsync and CollapseTaskAsync, ScrollToTaskAsync(id, expand), UpdateTaskAsync(id, updates, silent) and UpdateOptionsAsync. UpdateAsync() now sends the tasks only when the task list changed, so an option change keeps the edits made in the chart and the undo history (UpdateAsync(replaceTasks: true) reloads the list as before). TaskUpdateEventArgs and TaskUpdateSuccessEventArgs gain Source (TaskUpdateSource constants: api, dialog, drag, inline, keyboard, progress, resize); with 3.20 these events fire for every edit path, so an app that saves on both OnTaskDragged and OnTaskUpdateSuccess saves a drag twice. GanttTask.BarTextColor and GanttTaskInfo.BarTextColor added; DependencyLinkInfo added. TaskDependency.LagUnit and the LagUnit enum are [Obsolete]: they never had an effect. AddDependencyAsync now throws for a self-link, a cycle or a summary-descendant link. Only a Premium or higher licence key removes the watermark.\n\n      1.3.0 Update ApexGantt core to 3.15.0 (from ~3.11). Load the core as a self-contained ES module (no script tag or CDN needed). Port the expanded 3.15 API: dependencies-as-objects with lag/type, baselines, working calendar, assignees, task segments, summary bars, column configuration, sorting/grouping/filtering, critical path, crosshair, undo/redo history, and many appearance options; add all 20 core events and a public method API (task CRUD, dependencies, undo/redo, sort/group/filter, columns, selection, zoom, export). Note: the obsolete ViewMode and EnableToolbar options were removed (use PixelsPerDay and the toolbar options); per-task Color/ClassName/CustomData were replaced by BarBackgroundColor/RowBackgroundColor and inline additional data.\n\n      1.2.0 License Manager\n      1.0.0 Initial release",
